*Context: *One of my favorite things about following the NBA is the
constant churn of the rumor mill. It=E2=80=99s been a while since we caught=
 up on
some industry gossip, so this new Leiphone Detectives series [AI=E6=83=85=
=E6=8A=A5=E5=B1=80] caught
